{
    "eo": {
        "Trunks": "Trunks",
        "And so he left, putting his fear aside.": "Kaj tiel li foriris, metante sian timon flanken.",
        "KINGMOD_TRUNKS_SKIN_DBS": "DBS",
        "KINGMOD_TRUNKS_SKIN_DBZ": "DBZ",
        "Saiyan Blood": "Sango de Saiyan",
        "Skills also require <color=#03bcff>Ki</color> to be used!\nPerform a <color=#FF5400>Main Transformation</color> by tapping <color=#03f4fc>C</color> (View Transformations Tab for more info).\n<color=#FF5400>Power down</color> by tapping <color=#03f4fc>X</color>.\n<color=#FF5400>Fly</color> by holding <color=#03f4fc>Jump</color>.": "Kapabloj ankaux postulas <color=#03bcff>Ki</color> por esti uzataj!\nPlenumu <color=#FF5400>Cxefan Transformigxon</color> premante <color=#03f4fc>C</color> (Vidu la langeton pri Transformigxoj por pliaj informoj).\n<color=#FF5400>Malaktivigu formon</color> premante <color=#03f4fc>X</color>.\n<color=#FF5400>Flugu</color> tenante <color=#03f4fc>Salti</color>.",
        "Sword Strike": "Glava Bato",
        "Deal <color=#E5C962>320% Damage</color> each strike!\nGain <color=#03bcff>9% Ki</color> Per Hit!\n<color=#03f4fc>Auto-moves to targeted enemies.</color>": "Kauxzas <color=#E5C962>320% da Damagxo</color> je cxiu bato!\nGajnu <color=#03bcff>9% da Ki</color> por Trafito!\n<color=#03f4fc>Auxtomate movigxas al celitaj malamikoj.</color>",
        "Sword Strike Alternate": "Glava Bato (Alternativa)",
        "Deal <color=#E5C962>320% Damage</color> each strike!\nGain <color=#03bcff>9% Ki</color> Per Hit!\n<color=#03f4fc>Free movement, but does not Auto-Move.</color>": "Kauxzas <color=#E5C962>320% da Damagxo</color> je cxiu bato!\nGajnu <color=#03bcff>9% da Ki</color> por Trafito!\n<color=#03f4fc>Libera movigxo, sed ne auxtomate movigxas.</color>",
        "Shining Sword Attack": "Shining Sword Attack",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>30 Ki</color>\nDash towards a target and rapidly unleash a barrage of sword strikes! \nDealing <color=#E5C962>240% Damage</color> for each one!\n<color=#03f4fc>Holding this skill drains </color><color=#03bcff>10% Ki </color><color=#03f4fc>per second.</color>\nOnce released, unleash an additional energy blast, dealing <color=#E5C962>660% Damage</color>!": "Kostas <color=#03bcff>30 Ki</color>\nImpetu al celo kaj rapide liberigu sinsekvon de glavaj batoj! \nKauxzante <color=#E5C962>240% da Damagxo</color> por cxiu!\n<color=#03f4fc>Teni cxi tiun kapablon konsumas </color><color=#03bcff>10% da Ki </color><color=#03f4fc>cxiusekunde.</color>\nPost malteno, liberigu aldonan energian eksplodon, kauxzante <color=#E5C962>660% da Damagxo</color>!",
        "Ki Charge": "Ki-Sxargxo",
        "Hold and Regenerate <color=#03bcff>20% Ki</color> Per Second!": "Tenu kaj Regeneru <color=#03bcff>20% da Ki</color> Cxiusekunde!",
        "Flip": "Salto",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>20 Ki</color>\nPerform a quick flip in a direction.\n<color=#03f4fc>Gain Invulnerability whilst skill is active</color>": "Kostas <color=#03bcff>20 Ki</color>\nPlenumu rapidan kaptranssalton en direkto.\n<color=#03f4fc>Gajnu Nevundeblon dum la kapablo estas aktiva</color>",
        "Burning Attack": "Burning Attack",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>50 Ki</color>\nPerform a series of rapid arm movements, firing a flaming explosive ball of energy! \nExplodes on hit, Dealing <color=#E5C962>1700% Damage</color>!\n": "Kostas <color=#03bcff>50 Ki</color>\nPlenumu serion da rapidaj brakmovoj, pafante flaman eksplodeman globon de energio! \nEksplodas je trafo, kauxzante <color=#E5C962>1700% da Damagxo</color>!\n",
        "Swift Massacre": "Rapida Masakro",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>100 Ki</color>\nVanish at light speed and swiftly strike nearby enemies in front dealing <color=#E5C962>1400% Damage</color>!\n<color=#03f4fc>Additional Damage is dealt when the same target is hit more than once.</color>\n<color=#03f4fc>Duration can be extended at the cost of </color><color=#03bcff>80 Ki</color><color=#03f4fc> per second!</color>\n<color=#999999>The number of strikes scales off attack speed.</color>": "Kostas <color=#03bcff>100 Ki</color>\nMalaperu je lumrapido kaj rapide batu proksimajn malamikojn antauxe kauxzante <color=#E5C962>1400% da Damagxo</color>!\n<color=#03f4fc>Aldona Damagxo estas kauxzata kiam la sama celo estas trafita pli ol unufoje.</color>\n<color=#03f4fc>Dauxro povas esti plilongigita kontraux </color><color=#03bcff>80 Ki</color><color=#03f4fc> cxiusekunde!</color>\n<color=#999999>La nombro da batoj kreskas laux atakrapideco.</color>",
        "Change The Future": "Sxangxi la Estontecon",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>100 Ki</color>\nQuickly fire a large explosion! \nDamaging all enemies in front, Dealing <color=#E5C962>1000% Damage</color>!\n": "Kostas <color=#03bcff>100 Ki</color>\nRapide pafu grandan eksplodon! \nDamagxante cxiujn malamikojn antauxe, kauxzante <color=#E5C962>1000% da Damagxo</color>!\n",
        "Heat Dome Attack": "Heat Dome Attack",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>100 Ki</color>\nGenerate immense power to fire an energy wave upwards, dealing <color=#E5C962>3600% Damage</color> per second whilst the blast is active!\nBurn nearby enemies while charging, dealing <color=#E5C962>300% Damage</color> per second!\nConsume additional Ki and increase damage by <color=#E5C962>1600% Damage</color> and size per second of charging!\n<color=#03f4fc>Ki consumption gradually increases the longer you charge!</color>": "Kostas <color=#03bcff>100 Ki</color>\nGeneru grandegan potencon por pafi energian ondon supren, kauxzante <color=#E5C962>3600% da Damagxo</color> cxiusekunde dum la radio estas aktiva!\nBruligu proksimajn malamikojn dum sxargxado, kauxzante <color=#E5C962>300% da Damagxo</color> cxiusekunde!\nKonsumu aldonan Ki kaj pliigu damagxon je <color=#E5C962>1600% da Damagxo</color> kaj grandecon por sekundo da sxargxado!\n<color=#03f4fc>Ki-konsumo iom post iom kreskas ju pli longe vi sxargxas!</color>",
        "Inexperienced Power Up": "Senhava Plifortigxo",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>50 Ki</color>\nChannel your Saiyan strength, gaining <color=#E5C962>30% Damage</color> and <color=#00FF00>15% Health Regen</color> for 10 seconds!": "Kostas <color=#03bcff>50 Ki</color>\nEnkanaligu vian Saiyan-forton, gajnante <color=#E5C962>30% da Damagxo</color> kaj <color=#00FF00>15% da Sanregenerado</color> dum 10 sekundoj!",
        "Masenko": "Masenko",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>70 Ki</color>\nUnleash the signature Masenko, Dealing <color=#E5C962>1850% Damage</color> per second whilst the blast is active!": "Kostas <color=#03bcff>70 Ki</color>\nLiberigu la karakterizan Masenko, kauxzante <color=#E5C962>1850% da Damagxo</color> cxiusekunde dum la radio estas aktiva!",
        "Sword Of Hope": "Glavo de Espero",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>300 Ki</color>\nWith an unwavering spirit, summon the Sword of Hope\nGranting a bonus <color=#E5C962>80% Damage</color> and <color=#E5C962>60% Critical Strike Chance</color> while active.\n<color=#03f4fc>This skill requires </color><color=#097CFF>Light Charge </color><color=#03f4fc>to be full and consumes it over time</color>": "Kostas <color=#03bcff>300 Ki</color>\nKun nesxancelebla spirito, alvoku la Glavon de Espero\nDonante kromon de <color=#E5C962>80% da Damagxo</color> kaj <color=#E5C962>60% da Kritika Trafa Sxanco</color> dum aktiva.\n<color=#03f4fc>Cxi tiu kapablo postulas ke </color><color=#097CFF>Luma Sxargxo </color><color=#03f4fc>estu plena kaj konsumas gxin lauxlonge de la tempo</color>",
